            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa <code>bill</code> da <code>mod.js</code> in modo che l'importo di <code>bill</code> venga visualizzato nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"default\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill;\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"(node:7) Warning: To load an ES module, set &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot; in the package.json or use the .mjs extension.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"/home/default/code/file.js:3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export default bill;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"^^^^^^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: Unexpected token 'export'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at wrapSafe (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:915:16)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Module._compile (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:963:27)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Object.Module._extensions..js (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:1027:10)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Module.load (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:863:32)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Function.Module._load (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:708:14)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Function.executeUserEntryPoint [as runMain] (internal/modules/run_main.js:60:12)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at internal/main/run_main_module.js:17:47\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bill);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"to\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;./script.js&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>import</code>, seguito da <code>bill</code> e poi <code>from</code>, <code>\"./mod.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa in questo file il valore predefinito del conto da <code>mod.js</code> prima di visualizzarlo nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bill\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"default\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bill\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bill);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"to\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;./script.js&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"export\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>import</code>, seguito da <code>bill</code>, <code>from</code> e infine <code>\"./mod.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
