            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il conto dovrebbe includere anche le tasse, quindi aggiungiamo una funzione a <code>mod.js</code> che aggiunga una tassa di <code>5</code> al conto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"bill\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"default\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bill);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>bill</code> e poi <code>+</code>, <code>5</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione di supporto riceve l'importo del conto. Restituiscilo dopo aver aggiunto la tassa di <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"bill\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"default\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bill);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>bill</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>5</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
