            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa entrambe le esportazioni con nome, quindi chiama <code>total</code> con <code>bill</code> affinché la console mostri l'importo tassato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"bill\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total};\" /></content></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total} \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total(bill));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bill\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"default\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"export\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"45\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>,</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
